# Machine-specific packages: bootloader, firmware, GPU, network hardware.
#
# Unlike the other applists, this file's CONTENTS are gitignored — they differ
# per machine and are not portable. Only this .example template is committed,
# so the concept is versioned even though the package names are not.
#
# On a new machine: copy this to applist-machine and fill it in with whatever
# that box needs. package_report counts entries here as tracked, so they stop
# showing up as untracked noise, but they are deliberately never part of the
# portable install manifest.
#
# cp applist-machine.example applist-machine
#
# Example entries (this machine's, as a starting point):
#
# grub
# efibootmgr
# intel-ucode
# nvidia-open
# nvidia-settings
# iwd
